for start the server 
node src/index.js

1 (Health Check)
powershell
curl.exe -X GET http://localhost:3000/health


2. (List Products)
powershell
curl.exe -X GET http://localhost:3000/products

3 . (Create Product by ID)
curl.exe -X POST http://localhost:3000/products -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"id\": \"500\", \"name\": \"Laptop\", \"price\": 1200}"

4. (Get by ID)
curl.exe -X GET http://localhost:3000/products/500

5 . (Update Product)
curl.exe -X PUT http://localhost:3000/products/500 -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"price\": 1300}"

6 .(Delete Product)
curl.exe -X DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/500

*7(Verify Delete)
powershell
curl.exe -X GET http://localhost:3000/products
